OL,3,AKate visits cancer patients in hospital
OL,4,Ashe funded with climb
OL,5,
OL,6,FCatherine, Princess of Wales has
OL,7,Fvisited the hospital where she was
OL,8,Ftreated for cancer after completing a
OL,9,Fcharity climb to help fund a new unit
OL,10,Fthere earlier this year.
OL,12,F"This was my small way of being able to
OL,13,Fgive back and say thank you,"
OL,14,FCatherine, who revealed she was
OL,15,Freceiving cancer treatment in March
OL,16,F2024, told staff at the Royal Marsden
OL,17,Fhospital in London on Friday.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,309,300,200,140,0,100
