OL,3,AKate visits cancer patients in hospital
OL,4,Ashe funded with climb
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe princess carried out the Three
OL,7,FPeaks Challenge in aid of the hospital
OL,8,Fin June, which involved climbing the
OL,9,Fhighest peaks in England, Scotland and
OL,10,FWales within 24 hours.
OL,12,FThe amount of money she raised has not
OL,13,Fbeen made public, but it will go
OL,14,Ftowards a new unit offering
OL,15,Fcomplementary healing alongside
OL,16,Fclinical care.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
